      "chunk_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "ECET:\n💪 Motto of Physical Education – KUCE&T\nAt KUCE&T, the Physical Education motto emphasizes holistic development including physical fitness, mental well-being, and strong moral character.\nVision\nKUCE&T envisions a vibrant sports culture where games such as Badminton, Football, Volleyball, Handball, Table Tennis, Lawn Tennis, Kho-Kho, Kabaddi, Chess, and Cricket are actively incorporated.\nYoga and Martial Arts are integrated to nurture mental focus and inner peace.\nMission\nFostering all-round growth with physical and mental resilience\nInstilling discipline, team spirit, and sportsmanship\nEmphasizing stress management, focus, and fair play\nIntroduction\nUnder the dedicated guidance of",
      "token_count": 126
